{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788049922351181544,"compiled_state":{"alias":"democratic-untiring-saiga","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c2c99f1559b632081534e0265cc5807a3c52a39f215cd57804cd68e9a0284107","event_uuid":"4b7f4d6e-a7a4-48a0-8b22-c678678f1c15","position":{"commit_sha":"1459821f8921f10c2a29420532719805db42fd3e","position":"1788046506939773619-4b7f4d6e-a7a4-48a0-8b22-c678678f1c15"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ba04a174356ba055749d5a929695c90c6b77924a433b0decd503ab5a97b82be9","event_uuid":"18002c7d-361c-4a00-af08-6ce94a8235a2","position":{"commit_sha":"2c6f381181ceaa3506f2ceeca2b4370e3f8d491f","position":"1788046620861703533-18002c7d-361c-4a00-af08-6ce94a8235a2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f35229c08c7dd71ce67935f15356257123e1227b8f01c7ec02ae7d561269438e","event_uuid":"6414ac97-be54-4844-8439-c203356569f7","position":{"commit_sha":"c86ada6eb4d4b30cdda99e01b1978678881bdcc8","position":"1788046621011516051-6414ac97-be54-4844-8439-c203356569f7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788046506939773619,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"18002c7d-361c-4a00-af08-6ce94a8235a2","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"bdf3-e7e3-c96f-4b9f"},{"link_uuid":"6414ac97-be54-4844-8439-c203356569f7","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"4b2a-3ae8-14ee-463a"}],"description":"## Context\n\nBefore any human go/no-go on a prod swap, the reclaim must be proven end-to-end on a throwaway\nshadow clone. This story is the DRY-RUN harness that produces the evidence packet.\n\n## Scope\n\nRun S1 (collapse + ledger reconcile) then S2's swap adapters against a throwaway shadow clone /\nfake remote, and produce a measured evidence report: `rebar verify-authorship` clean on the\nrewritten graph, reducer-state equality vs the pre-reclaim baseline, and the measured blobless\npack-size before/after with the delta compared to the epic's prediction (~365-380 MiB at N=30d).\nThis is the artifact escalated to the human for the pre-swap go/no-go.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nAny mutation of the real prod `tickets` remote or the Gerrit box. HARD STOP: the actual prod swap\nis a separate, human-authorized step.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The harness runs S1+S2 against a throwaway shadow clone and fake remote with no real-remote access.\n- [ ] It asserts `rebar verify-authorship` is clean on the rewritten graph and reducer-state equality holds vs the pre-reclaim baseline.\n- [ ] It reports measured blobless pack size before/after and the delta vs the epic's prediction, in a machine-readable evidence packet.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] The harness is escalated to a human for the pre-swap go/no-go; no prod swap is executed by this story.\n\n## Portability\n\nUses only core-git, throwaway local remotes, and the store's S3 seam via a fake-S3 fixture; no dependence on any single CI provider.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","4b2a-3ae8-14ee-463a"],["depends_on","bdf3-e7e3-c96f-4b9f"],["parent","536b-8930-b922-4063"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"536b-8930-b922-4063","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"8dc4-1541-92a7-4351","ticket_type":"story","title":"S3: dry-run reclaim harness on a throwaway shadow clone (verify-authorship + measured shrink)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4b7f4d6e-a7a4-48a0-8b22-c678678f1c15","18002c7d-361c-4a00-af08-6ce94a8235a2","6414ac97-be54-4844-8439-c203356569f7"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788049922351181544,"uuid":"de9cd56c-2db7-4510-9a09-9fe3bb6752bd"}